<mj-raw>*|IF:recipientIsChild|*</mj-raw>
<mj-text>
  You can also contribute to the Additional Investment Fund with a recurring payment. This way
  a contribution reaches your child's account every month without you having to think about it
  separately.
</mj-text>
<mj-text>
  <strong>If there is no recurring payment yet, you can set one up in your Tuleva account:</strong>
</mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/savings-fund/payment/child/*|recipientAccountId|*?language=en&type=RECURRING&utm_content=nudge_savings_fund_recurring_child">
  Set up recurring payment
</mj-button>
<mj-text>
  You can change the amount of an existing recurring payment in your online bank at any time.
</mj-text>
